ether you know various doctors  on his team they did it with several of  them and then eventually season six I  think it was the very end of season five  they had house hook up with his boss  with cut I think season well would need  whatever it was so second to last season  was where the relationship played out  and and the finale from the season  before I forget how many seasons their  world where there's seven or were there  eight I don't know but when when he and  Cuddy started hooking up my immediate  thought was next year needs to be the  last season because this will not be  allowed to stand too much of houses  characterization is dependent on him  being miserable and if the next season  is the last season  then maybe he can have this and we'll  wrap everything up maybe they can  sustain this first season but they won't  be able to sustain it past that but the  next season wasn't the last season and  that entire thing blew up and then Cuddy  didn't even appear and the season that  followed she was written out of the show  and I don't know if that was because  Lisa Edelson didn't want to come back  maybe it was but I mean they also had  exhausted any possibilities for the  character they completely used her up  but she was a great character so that's  sort of my ramble and my issues with  romantic subplots and why I am NOT and I  don't think we'll ever really consider  myself to be a shipper even though every  now and then I'll be like maybe those  two so I don't want to ask for people's  thoughts on shipping in general because  I think then we'll just get it into a  debate of uh shipping stupid or shipping  rate or whatever but is there a romantic  subplot that particularly annoyed you  was there one that you wanted to see  happen that didn't whatever your  thoughts are along those lines or about  anything else that I've said please keep  it respectful drop something down in the  comments let's talk about it there's  also a whole bunch of buttons down there  i